    "bio": "==Biography==\n\n    * There is no evidence presented by the family historian that he and his wife are related on this side of the Atlantic.\n\n      According to the family history, \"He was a carpenter, or 'housewright,' and lived at Fairview on the paternal homestead on South street.\" His reference here is to the History of Fairview (2.476). [1]\n\n \n== Sources ==\n<references/>\t\n\n   1. [S362] History of the Hartley Family: An Account of the Descendants of Caleb Hartley of Fairview, 1837-1920., Hartley Society, (Worcester: Commonwealth Press, 1923), 10.\n\n   2. [S366] History of the Town of Fairview, George Hartley, et al., (Fairview: Town of Fairview, 1893), 2.476-77.\n\n   3. [S366] History of the Town of Fairview, George Hartley, et al., (Fairview: Town of Fairview, 1893), 2.476.\n\n   4. [S366] History of the Town of Fairview, George Hartley, et al., (Fairview: Town of Fairview, 1893), 2.460, 2.476.",
